{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13125","headline":"江草歌送卢判官 · 皇甫冉","name":"江草歌送卢判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江臯兮春早，江上兮芳草。\n杂蘼芜兮杜蘅，作丛秀兮欲罗生。\n被遥隰兮经长衍，雨中深兮烟中浅。\n目眇眇兮增愁，步迟迟兮堪搴。\n澧之浦兮湘之滨，思夫君兮送美人。\n吴洲曲兮楚乡路，远孤城兮依独戎。\n新月能分裛露时，夕阳照见连天处。\n问君行迈将何之，淹泊沿洄风日迟。\n处处汀洲有芳草，王孙讵肯念归期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}